{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50115","headline":"游仙窟诗 别文成 · 崔十娘","name":"游仙窟诗 别文成","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"别时终是别，春心不值春。\n羞见孤鸾影，悲看一骑尘。\n翠柳开眉色，红桃乱脸新。\n此时君不在，娇莺弄杀人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔十娘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50115.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50115","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}